{"task": {"role": "You read the description of an outfit and list its items as data.", "rules": ["One object per item — garment, shoes, bag, accessory, jewelry — in the order of the description, with its words and hex.", "One item carries one thing — of two alternatives list the first; a note in brackets is not an item.", "Slot "accessory" is for an item no other slot fits.", ""is_outfit" says whether the description is an outfit: no — when in place of items it has a refusal, a question or a note."], "limits": ["Rely only on the input: do not invent what it does not contain.", "The answer is one JSON object following "answer_schema", without explanations and without ```."], "language": "English", "answer": "ITEM_LIST", "answer_schema": {"is_outfit": "yes|no", "items": [{"name": "<what the item is>", "details": "<its cut, length and fabric>", "slot": "top|bottom|dress|set|outerwear|shoes|bag|scarf|headwear|belt|tights|socks|jewelry|earrings|collar_necklace|necklace|brooch|bracelet|ring|glasses|gloves|watch|swimwear|underwear|accessory", "color_hex": "<#rrggbb or null>", "worn": "<true, or false when the description says the outfit goes without it>"}]}, "input": [""description" — the outfit description"]}, "description": "Chinos in a neutral taupe shade (#d1ad87), tailored to a straight-leg cut with a knee-length hem, crafted from a crisp cotton-elastic blend for all-day comfort;
A structured navy blazer featuring a notch lapel and single-breasted closure, falling to the hip in a classic fit, made of lightweight worsted wool suitable for autumn mornings;
Leather loafers in a soft cognac tone (#c8a27a), designed with a slip-on fit and no heel elevation, constructed from durable full-grain leather;
A simple pearl pendant necklace on a 45cm chain to add a subtle touch of polish without distraction;
This outfit works because it balances professional readiness with the relaxed atmosphere of a morning bank interview in autumn, respecting her refusal of heels by choosing elegant slip-ons. The combination of chinos and a blazer hits the "everyday" formality band perfectly while remaining comfortable for a full day of walking and sitting during the interview process."}

